              <mxCell id="n1" value="Any time during a case, PSO staff can print a complaint report (PDF).&#10;Staff may print only their own accepted complaints; a Supervisor or Admin may print any.&#10;The chat log is included only with a stated reason (Supervisor or Admin).&#10;Every print is saved in the Case Print Log with a document number (PSO-CMP-year-number).&#10;A case that is still open prints with an OPEN CASE watermark." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="1925" width="630" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
